msgid ""
"The device <b>{device}</b> is currently mounted and in use.\n"
"\n"
"Performing '<b>{operation}</b>' operation on a mounted device can result in:\n"
"  • Data loss\n"
"  • System instability\n"
"  • File system corruption\n"
"\n"
"Are you sure you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Perangkat <b>{device}</b> saat ini sedang ter-mount dan digunakan.\n"
"\n"
"Melakukan operasi '<b>{operation}</b>' pada perangkat yang ter-mount dapat menyebabkan:\n"
"  • Kehilangan data\n"
"  • Ketidakstabilan sistem\n"
"  • Kerusakan sistem file\n"
"\n"
"Apakah Anda yakin ingin melanjutkan?"

